   _VGradient colour colour_, or _none_.
|  *border.active.image*
:  PNG, SVG, or XPM image painted over the active border.  Use _none_ to clear.
|  *border.active.n*
:  Active border: north edge.
|  *border.active.n.gradient*
:  Active north edge gradient.  The same *.gradient* suffix is available for
   _s_, _e_, _w_, _nw_, _ne_, _sw_, and _se_.
|  *border.active.n.image*
:  Active north edge image.  The same *.image* suffix is available for _s_,
